/// How a unit-mix line is disposed of. Only DEVELOPER_SALE units may produce
/// sale revenue; owner-replacement and retained units are built but not sold.
/// UNCLASSIFIED is the safe default: it earns nothing until somebody says what
/// the line is, so an unreviewed import cannot silently inflate revenue.
enum FeasibilityUnitDisposition {
  UNCLASSIFIED
  DEVELOPER_SALE
  OWNER_REPLACEMENT
  RETAINED
}

/// Where a regulatory threshold comes from. An appraiser has to be able to say
